## Exp45 — Conditional Exit-Side Transport Confirmation — FULL PASS

Frozen question: conditional on realized exit by horizon, does original TRAIN-fitted `POSITION_SURV` improve ADVANCE-vs-RECAPTURE prediction relative to `BASE_SURV` with no refit/new feature?

Frozen probabilities:

```text
q_ADV_BASE = CIF_ADV_BASE/(CIF_ADV_BASE+CIF_REC_BASE)
q_ADV_POS  = CIF_ADV_POS /(CIF_ADV_POS +CIF_REC_POS)
y_side=1 ADVANCE, 0 RECAPTURE
```

`NO_EXIT` excluded by definition. Same 8 joint environments and horizons `15/30/60/120m`. All environments scorable: 587–1212 exit-cells, both classes present, 20–32 contributing BRT days.

